                "loc": "MRK.9.14+MRK.9.15+MRK.9.16+MRK.9.17+MRK.9.18+MRK.9.19+MRK.9.20+MRK.9.21+MRK.9.22+MRK.9.23+MRK.9.24+MRK.9.25+MRK.9.26+MRK.9.27+MRK.9.28+MRK.9.29"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mk 9:14-29",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LUK.9.37+LUK.9.38+LUK.9.39+LUK.9.40+LUK.9.41+LUK.9.42"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Lk 9:37-42",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nao walipoufikia mkutano, mtu mmoja akamjia, akampigia magoti, akisema, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.17.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.17.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 17:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bwana, umrehemu mwanangu, kwa kuwa ana kifafa, na kuteswa vibaya; maana mara nyingi huanguka motoni, na mara nyingi majini. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.17.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.17.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 17:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nikamleta kwa wanafunzi wako, wasiweze kumponya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.17.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.17.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 17:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.32.5"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kum 32:5",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JHN.14.9"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yn 14:9",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yesu akajibu, akasema, Enyi kizazi kisichoamini, kilichopotoka, nitakaa pamoja nanyi hata lini? Nitachukuliana nanyi hata lini? Mleteni huku kwangu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.17.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.17.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 17:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yesu akamkemea pepo, naye akamtoka; yule kijana akapona tangu saa ile. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.17.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.17.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 17:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MAT.10.1"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mt 10:1",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kisha wale wanafunzi wakamwendea Yesu kwa faragha wakasema Mbona sisi hatukuweza kumtoa? ",
