                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hata walipofika Kapernaumu, wale watozao nusu-shekeli walimwendea Petro, wakasema, Je! Mwalimu wenu hatoi nusu-shekeli? Akasema, Hutoa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.17.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.17.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 17:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naye alipoingia nyumbani, Yesu alitangulia kumwuliza, akisema, Waonaje, Simoni? Wafalme wa dunia hutwaa kodi ama ushuru kwa watu gani? Kwa wana wao au kwa wageni? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.17.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.17.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 17:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naye aliposema, Kwa wageni, Yesu alimwambia, Basi, kama ni hivyo, wana ni mahuru. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.17.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.17.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 17:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lakini tusije tukawakwaza, enenda baharini ukatupe ndoana, ukatwae samaki yule azukaye kwanza; na ukifumbua mdomo wake utaona shekeli",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.17.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.17.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
